<title>HONG KONG: Fairform's HK share offer 56.8 times subscribed.</title>
<headline>Fairform's HK share offer 56.8 times subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong-based household and bathroom products maker Fairform Holdings Ltd said on Sunday its public offer of shares was about 56.8 times subscribed.</p>
<p>It was issuing 57 million new shares at HK$1.08 each in an initial public offering in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>Trading of the shares on the local stock exchange is expected to start on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
